cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use CoRATES in your research, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: CoRATES (Collaborative Research Appraisal Tool for Evidence Synthesis)
abstract: >-
  CoRATES is a web application for collaborative critical appraisal in
  evidence synthesis. Reviewers appraise studies with AMSTAR 2, RoB 2 and
  ROBINS-I, reconcile independent appraisals, and produce risk-of-bias
  figures and tables.
authors:
  - family-names: Maynard
    given-names: Jacob A.
  - family-names: Maynard
    given-names: Brandy R.
    affiliation: Saint Louis University
url: https://corates.org
repository-code: https://github.com/InfinityBowman/corates
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
keywords:
  - evidence synthesis
  - systematic review
  - risk of bias
  - critical appraisal
  - AMSTAR 2
  - RoB 2
  - ROBINS-I
